# Shared inference packages follow Hou's cpmo_35A3 environment. Demo-only
# service packages follow .venv-accel. Compile or resolve this input for Python
# 3.11 and CUDA 12.8; the checked-in resolved snapshot is:
#   requirements-align-tts-py311-cu128.lock
